stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> OPEN_EXTERNAL: instance blocked by a fence or an unpublished format
    [*] --> OPEN_PARAMETER: due date or slab is an uncaptured parameter
    [*] --> OPEN_AUTHORITY: portal or regime unresolved for the period

    OPEN_EXTERNAL --> WATCHED: watch key registered against the blocker
    OPEN_PARAMETER --> WATCHED: capture task raised with the statutory desk
    OPEN_AUTHORITY --> WATCHED: successor instrument watch registered

    WATCHED --> READY: blocker resolved and the rule or format is published
    WATCHED --> WATCHED: monthly ageing review with no change
    READY --> CLOSED: line re-versioned on the coverage statement and instances re-enter the denominator
    CLOSED --> REOPENED: blocker returns, for example a corrigendum withdraws the format
    REOPENED --> WATCHED: entry re-ages from the reopening date
    CLOSED --> [*]

    note right of WATCHED
        Entries never expire silently.
        Ageing above the review threshold
        escalates to the statutory desk lead.
    end note
